cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Robust Autonomous Docking and Traversal of Robotic Motorway Barriers"
abstract: >-
  A mecanum-wheeled mobile robot that autonomously docks with a movable motorway
  barrier segment and traverses along it, localising against a ChArUco fiducial
  using Conv-ChArT, a convolutional-transformer pose estimator trained entirely
  on synthetic data and run off-board over WiFi while state estimation and
  control remain on the robot.
type: software
